    "item_data_json": "{\"options\":{\"A\":\"Continue metformin and lisinopril, checking renal function only if oliguria develops after the procedure.\",\"B\":\"Withhold metformin at or before contrast, recheck renal function about 48 hours later, and restart if stable.\",\"C\":\"Hold lisinopril but continue metformin, because ACE inhibition is the medication-related concern with contrast.\",\"D\":\"Give both medications as scheduled and use oral hydration alone as the medication-related contrast precaution.\"}}",
